{"script":"yd_012_07-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1d","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":277.5,"y":-419,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1d","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"y":-419,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]在外面呆久了，还点怀念我的老家巴诺姆村呢。[r]那村子在高高的索利德山上，离这里可远了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]那地方非常封闭，哪怕是在大兽潮来临前也是如此。[r]村子里的人也基本只会在村内活动，别说下山，很多人可能连村子都没出过。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]得益于我猎人的身份，我经常出村子打猎，接触过很多没见过的事，遇见了形形色色的人。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]可惜我和村子里的人谈这些事情的时候，他们没有一点兴趣。[r]人总不能一辈子守着自己那一亩三分地吧，就算是我也不是只守着一个猎场打猎的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]我难以适应那种封闭的环境，更不理解一些村民们过度自守的想法。[r]所以我最后选择了离开故乡。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"y":-419,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"沃夫加-巴诺姆村的回忆"}